akerId":30606,"speakerName":"エロフ","textMapHash":3479375850,"text":"#オルビット城へようこそ。{NICKNAME}さん、パイモンさん。","nextNodeIds":[790710102]},{"nodeId":790710102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30606,"speakerName":"エロフ","textMapHash":1301979522,"text":"あなたたちのお名前と功績については、同僚から聞いています。まさに勇者の名にふさわしい人物だと思います。","nextNodeIds":[790710103]},{"nodeId":790710103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30606,"speakerName":"エロフ","textMapHash":3211887842,"text":"守衛の訓練を任されていなければ、お二人に手合わせを願いたいところだったのですが…","nextNodeIds":[790710104]},{"nodeId":790710104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3726225474,"text":"王城の守衛なの？","nextNodeIds":[790710105]},{"nodeId":790710105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30606,"speakerName":"エロフ","textMapHash":1194426994,"text":"はい。城主様の命を受け、オルビット城の安寧と平和を守ることが私の仕事です。","nextNodeIds":[790710106]},{"nodeId":790710106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30606,"speakerName":"エロフ","textMapHash":3428377562,"text":"具体的には、守衛たちの戦闘力を鍛え、職務を全うできるようサポートしています。","nextNodeIds":[790710107]},{"nodeId":790710107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":910535282,"text":"後ろにあるのは訓練場？","nextNodeIds":[790710108]},{"nodeId":790710108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30606,"speakerName":"エロフ","textMapHash":3951491626,"text":"ええ、先日改修を終えたばかりでして。入り口が秘境につながっています。","nextNodeIds":[790710109]},{"nodeId":790710109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30606,"speakerName":"エロフ","textMapHash":3463295682,"text":"訓練場では、特定のリズムに合わせて剣を振らせています。戦闘中は場内の照明環境も変化し続けるんですよ。","nextNodeIds":[790710110]},{"nodeId":790710110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1939353826,"text":"厳しいんだね…","nextNodeIds":[790710111]},{"nodeId":790710111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1804763450,"text":"リズムに合わせて戦わないといけないなんて、難しそうだよな。","nextNodeIds":[790710112]},{"nodeId":790710112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30606,"speakerName":"エロフ","textMapHash":1079407074,"text":"実は、この訓練方法は『フクロウ楽師』という物語を参考に考案したものなんです。","nextNodeIds":[790710113]},{"nodeId":790710113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30606,"speakerName":"エロフ","textMapHash":2966125794,"text":"その本は守衛の間で大変人気で、物語に夢中になるあまり、訓練のことさえ忘れる者も多々ありました。日ごろの巡回にまで影響が出るほどで。","nextNodeIds":[790710114]},{"nodeId":790710114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30606,"speakerName":"エロフ","textMapHash":1702874482,"text":"そこで私はひらめいたのです。物語の要素を訓練に取り入れれば、皆がより訓練に集中できるのでは、と。","nextNodeIds":[790710115]},{"nodeId":790710115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30606,"speakerName":"エロフ","textMapHash":57213994,"text":"その試みは効果抜群で、少なくとも…個人的な理由で巡回をすっぽかす者はいなくなりました。","nextNodeIds":[790710116]},{"nodeId":790710116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30606,"speakerName":"エロフ","textMapHash":896912818,"text":"はは…ところで、訓練にご興味は？","nextNodeIds":[790710117]},{"nodeId":790710117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30606,"speakerName":"エロフ","textMapHash":2045919042,"text":"あなたたちの武勇をもってすれば、訓練場の各種試練にも難なく対処できるでしょう。","nextNodeIds":[790710118,790710120]},{"nodeId":790710118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":193661714,"text":"試してみたい！","nextNodeIds":[790710119]},{"nodeId":790710119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30606,"speakerName":"エロフ","textMapHash":3887384322,"text":"その勇気に敬服いたします。それでは、秘境へお進みください。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":790710120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3943971810,"text":"他に用事がある…","nextNodeIds":[790710121]},{"nodeId":790710121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30606,"speakerName":"エロフ","textMapHash":4172797858,"text":"お気になさらず。もし時間があったらまた来てくださいね。しばらくここで見張りをしていますので。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7907101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NON